    "content": "Run:ai's project figures count GPUs of **both vendors** in one number. On several nodes each vendor has its own node pool: the second table splits each project by pool (`nvidia`, `amd`, `default`); on a single node the vendor split is in the per-vendor caps below (ADR-015)."
